{"text": "In the third round Sandel left an opening, and Toms hook caught him on the jaw and sent him to the floor until the count of nine. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Had the blow landed an inch nearer the point of the chin, Tom thought, the fight would have ended there, and the thirty pounds would have been his. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Tom often held the young man in a clinch to rest, while Sandel, who had never learned to rest, wasted his strength on wild swings. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In the ninth round Tom knocked him down three times, yet each time the young man rose again, his youth quickly bringing back his strength. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In the tenth round a blow to the side of the head stunned Tom for a moment, but he recovered and twice sent Sandel to the floor. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A police captain moved to stop the fight, which would have given Tom the purse, but Sandel protested that he was still perfectly fit. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then Tom remembered the words a rich gentleman had said to him long ago, after he had beaten Stowsher Bill, Youth will be served. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Now that phrase was turning against him, and with every minute he felt his strength draining away, while his body cried out for food.", "alignment": {"characters": ["I", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "t", "h", "i", "r", "d", " ", "r", "o", "u", "n", "d", " ", "S", "a", "n", "d", "e", "l", " ", "l", "e", "f", "t", " ", "a", "n", " ", "o", "p", "e", "n", "i", "n", "g", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "T", "o", "m", "s", " ", "h", "o", "o", "k", " ", "c", "a", "u", "g", "h", "t", " ", "h", "i", "m", " ", "o", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "j", "a", "w", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "s", "e", "n", "t", " ", "h", "i", "m", " ", "t", "o", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "f", "l", "o", "o", "r", " ", "u", "n", "t", "i", "l", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "c", "o", "u", "n", "t", " ", "o", "f", " ", "n", "i", "n", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", 